PTX MP+bar.sync-count+third-thread
"A barrier with a thread count of 2 between P0 and P1; P2 does not take part and is not ordered. Expected: allowed."
{
x=0;
P1:r0=0;
P2:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 0,gpu 0 | P2@cta 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.weak x, 1   | bar.sync 1, 2  | ld.weak r1, x  ;
 bar.sync 1, 2  | ld.weak r0, x  |                ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P2:r1 == 0)
